estion":"What language or runtime do you need that Edge Functions' Deno/TypeScript runtime doesn't support?","type":"multiple_choice"},{"choices":["Less than 1 vCPU (fractional/shared)","1 vCPU","2 vCPU","4 vCPU or more","Not sure"],"id":"7be2426a-682e-4160-a65f-5b4e74e457c8","optional":false,"question":"How much CPU does a typical task need?","type":"single_choice"},{"choices":["Yes — needs occasional bursts to higher resources","No — steady, constant resource needs throughout","Not sure"],"id":"a59e39cb-7802-43aa-9e7e-aa723e1d03b1","optional":false,"question":"Does this workload need to burst to more CPU/memory temporarily (e.g. for a compile step or a parallel batch), or does it need steady, constant resources the whole time?","type":"single_choice"},{"choices":["Under 1 GB","1–4 GB","4–8 GB","8 GB or more","Not sure"],"id":"96b702cd-458c-4b03-bcd7-7bf8c3b2bd2b","optional":false,"question":"How much memory does a typical task need?","type":"single_choice"},{"choices":["Just 1","2–10","10–100","100+"],"id":"750cf7da-f3d8-4bd4-8096-9d844d7c5215","optional":false,"question":"At peak, how many of these tasks run at the same time?","type":"single_choice"},{"branching":{"responseValues":{"0":11,"1":18,"2":25,"3":18},"type":"response_based"},"choices":["Mostly waiting (75%+)","A mix of both","Mostly computing (waiting under 25%)","Not sure"],"id":"be2d9277-f6e2-41be-b92c-7a9dcb4974ae","optional":false,"question":"Roughly what share of a task's time is spent waiting on external calls (LLM APIs, other services) versus actually computing?","type":"single_choice"},{"branching":{"responseValues":{"0":"end","1":"end","2":29,"3":29},"type":"response_based"},"choices":["Definitely would","Probably would","Probably would not","Definitely would not"],"id":"2ea3c6ce-e613-4ac4-b2a6-c318942aab9b","optional":false,"question":"At $2 for a 100-hour compute block, would you use Supabase Workers for the workload you described?","type":"single_choice"},{"branching":{"responseValues":{"0":"end","1":"end","2":8,"3":8},"type":"response_based"},"choices":["Definitely would","Probably would","Probably would not","Definitely would not"],"id":"cf9b781c-799f-4746-8db5-2233633686c2","optional":false,"question":"At $4 for a 100-hour compute block, would you use Supabase Workers for the workload you described?","type":"single_choice"},{"branching":{"responseValues":{"0":"end","1":"end","2":9,"3":9},"type":"response_based"},"choices":["Definitely would","Probably would","Probably would not","Definitely would not"],"id":"4baaa843-1008-4beb-a680-cc7962a3da0c","optional":false,"question":"At $6 for a 100-hour compute block, would you use Supabase Workers for the workload you described?","type":"single_choice"},{"branching":{"responseValues":{"0":12,"1":12,"2":10,"3":10},"type":"response_based"},"choices":["Definitely would","Probably would","Probably would not","Definitely would not"],"description":"Thanks for the details! We're exploring a new offering, Supabase Workers — general-purpose compute for longer-running background tasks (AI agents, data pipelines, and more) beyond what Edge Functions supports today. Think of pricing in terms of a 100-hour block of compute each month for a workload like yours — however that's split across however many workers you'd run. A few quick questions on what you'd consider a fair price for that block.","descriptionContentType":"text","id":"3ce4081d-81d1-4995-bca5-556320d129a2","optional":false,"question":"At $10 for a 100-hour compute block, would you use Supabase Workers for the workload you described?","type":"single_choice"},{"branching":{"responseValues":{"0":13,"1":13,"2":"end","3":"end"},"type":"response_based"},"choices":["Definitely would","Probably would","Probably would not","Definitely would not"],"id":"f3e39fb5-8de5-4ed5-b7b1-bba45354bafb","optional":false,"question":"At $16 for a 100-hour compute block, would you use Supabase Workers for the workload you described?","type":"single_choice"},{"branching":{"responseVal